# With the grocery list open in a second pane, deleting it in the first pane moves that pane up to Home, and undo brings the list back in both panes.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys G k k <C-w> v
see 󰋜 › Home › Groceries
keys g1 dd
see 󰋜 › Home
see ▌   - Laundry
hide Groceries
keys z
see ▌   - Groceries
see │      - Milk
keys g2 j
see │▌   - Groceries
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries @done({today})
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
